    description: Some("Waves of household junk — hamburgers, cookies, radial tyres, steam irons — sweep at your blaster along orbital paths that carry them off one edge and back in at the other. An energy bar drains as you work: empty it before the wave is clear and you lose a ship, clear it early and the remainder pays out as bonus."),
